testing
deployment
automation
documentation
tooling

Everything that participates in engineering.

5. Assessment Objectives

The assessment shall determine:

what exists
what is authoritative
what is duplicated
what is legacy
what is partially implemented
what is missing
what should be reused
what should be extended
what should be retired

The objective is evolution—not reconstruction.

6. Assessment Methodology

Every engineering capability shall be evaluated using the same institutional process.

Discover
        ↓
